<title>POLAND: RELPOL GROUP NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL GROUP NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL			    1997     1996</p>
<p> Group net profit	     0.89 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Froup pre-tax profit	 1.47 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Group operating profit     0.89 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Group sales		    8.02 vs   3.38</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL		  1997     1996</p>
<p> Group net profit	     3.99 vs   1.88</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 6.42 vs   2.76</p>
<p> Group operating profit     4.05 vs   2.14</p>
<p> Group sales		   30.41 vs  13.51</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electromagnetic transmiter maker</p>
<p>is Relpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
